        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion P-SG-A2-BSS, Solid Stainless Steel  Passage Lever Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis ultra modern solid Cast Stainless Steel lever made by Fusion Hardware features the clean lines and sleek appearance that is characteristic of the contemporary aesthetic--an appearance that is maintained by the concealed screw assembly. Brushed stainless steel finishes. <b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and with backset of 2-3/8 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion P-SG-A2-BSS Stainless Steel Lever With Contemporary Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Stainless Steel Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Fusion P-SG-A2-BSS Stainless Steel Lever With Contemporary Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Function: <b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** NONE available. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>",
